Package: libsedutil1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends:	${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Self Encrypting Drive utility library
 This library provides the core functionality for managing TCG OPAL 2.00
 compliant Self Encrypting Drives (SEDs).
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libsedutil-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:	libsedutil1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Self Encrypting Drive utility library - development files
 This library provides the core functionality for managing TCG OPAL 2.00
 compliant Self Encrypting Drives (SEDs).
 .
 This package contains the development files (headers and static library).

Package: sedutil
Architecture: any
Depends:	libsedutil1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: The Drive Trust Alliance Self Encrypting Drive Utility
 This program allows you to enable the locking in SED's that comply
 with the TCG OPAL 2.00 standard on bios machines.
 .
 This package contains the command-line utilities.
